[{"text":"i'm fine.","start":0,"end":0.69},{"text":"i said i'm fine, that's— four times, i know.","start":2.38,"end":5.91},{"text":"i can count.","start":6.96,"end":7.71},{"text":"i'm not gripping the wheel.","start":9.28,"end":10.69},{"text":"i'm just…","start":11.42,"end":12.13},{"text":"holding it.","start":12.13,"end":13.58},{"text":"that's what wheels are for.","start":14.36,"end":15.77},{"text":"yeah, the engine's off.","start":17.61,"end":19.08},{"text":"i know it's off.","start":20.01,"end":20.96},{"text":"i'm just sitting here.","start":22.65,"end":24.26},{"text":"what?","start":25.89,"end":26.14},{"text":"can't a guy sit in a car?","start":26.48,"end":28.91},{"text":"it was a good party.","start":30.7,"end":31.71},{"text":"it was fine.","start":32.73,"end":33.44},{"text":"everything's fine tonight, apparently.","start":34.69,"end":36.88},{"text":"very fine night.","start":36.88,"end":39.65},{"text":"hmmmmm.","start":39.65,"end":41.26},{"text":"sorry.","start":42.72,"end":43.59},{"text":"that came out— never mind.","start":43.59,"end":47.27},{"text":"no, i had fun.","start":47.27,"end":50.17},{"text":"i did.","start":50.17,"end":51.65},{"text":"i talked to…","start":51.65,"end":53.6},{"text":"people.","start":53.6,"end":54.62},{"text":"there were people.","start":54.93,"end":57.37},{"text":"i talked to some of them.","start":57.37,"end":59.87},{"text":"i don't know, an hour?","start":59.87,"end":62.91},{"text":"two?","start":62.91,"end":63.43},{"text":"i wasn't watching the clock.","start":63.8,"end":66.81},{"text":"i wasn't watching anything.","start":66.81,"end":69.36},{"text":"why are you looking at me like that.","start":69.36,"end":73.19},{"text":"i'm not avoiding your eyes, i'm looking at","start":73.19,"end":77.49},{"text":"the street.","start":77.49,"end":77.99},{"text":"there's a whole street out there.","start":77.99,"end":81.25},{"text":"very interesting street.","start":82.07,"end":84},{"text":"ahhhhh…","start":84,"end":87.69},{"text":"tired.","start":87.69,"end":89.54},{"text":"long night.","start":89.54,"end":90.92},{"text":"we should— you should probably head in, right?","start":91.23,"end":95.83},{"text":"it's late.","start":96.72,"end":97.41},{"text":"okay.","start":99.16,"end":99.61},{"text":"you're not moving.","start":101,"end":101.85},{"text":"great.","start":103.01,"end":103.42},{"text":"we're doing this.","start":104.71,"end":105.54},{"text":"doing what?","start":107.04,"end":107.71},{"text":"nothing.","start":109.24,"end":109.47},{"text":"we're doing nothing, that's my whole point,","start":110.81,"end":113.46},{"text":"there's nothing to— who?","start":114.01,"end":116.32},{"text":"him.","start":118.98,"end":119.23},{"text":"yeah.","start":120.83,"end":121.14},{"text":"no, i know who you mean.","start":122.26,"end":123.93},{"text":"i just— he seemed…","start":124.16,"end":126.5},{"text":"nice.","start":126.5,"end":127.76},{"text":"nice…","start":128.25,"end":128.94},{"text":"guy.","start":128.94,"end":130.18},{"text":"who exists.","start":130.18,"end":131.42},{"text":"and tells stories.","start":131.42,"end":133.58},{"text":"very long stories with a lot of hand gestures,","start":134.31,"end":137.94},{"text":"apparently, but who's counting the hand gestures.","start":137.94,"end":141.34},{"text":"not me.","start":142.09,"end":142.8},{"text":"that's not a tone.","start":143.7,"end":144.87},{"text":"this is my voice.","start":145.63,"end":146.72},{"text":"this is just how it sounds when i'm— when i'm","start":147.41,"end":151.45},{"text":"tired.","start":151.45,"end":151.63},{"text":"say it again?","start":152.93,"end":153.76},{"text":"no.","start":154.83,"end":155.26},{"text":"that's not— i'm not jealous.","start":155.97,"end":158.47},{"text":"i just— come here.","start":159.3,"end":161.37},{"text":"please.","start":162.09,"end":162.56},{"text":"just— ahhhhh.","start":163.31,"end":164.34},{"text":"okay.","start":164.34,"end":164.56},{"text":"okay, hold on.","start":164.56,"end":164.75},{"text":"give me a second, because i'm about to say","start":164.75,"end":173.28},{"text":"something stupid and it needs to come out in","start":173.28,"end":176.4},{"text":"the right order.","start":176.4,"end":177.1},{"text":"i watched you laugh tonight.","start":178.23,"end":179.7},{"text":"at whatever he said.","start":179.7,"end":181.92},{"text":"the thing with the— i couldn't even hear it","start":182.74,"end":186.05},{"text":"from across the room, and you did that laugh.","start":186.06,"end":188.97},{"text":"the real one.","start":189.7,"end":190.73},{"text":"the one where your whole head goes back and","start":191.4,"end":194.73},{"text":"you grab someone's arm because you can't— yeah.","start":194.73,"end":199.1},{"text":"that one.","start":199.77,"end":200.56},{"text":"and i stood there with my drink and i thought…","start":201.67,"end":204.74},{"text":"i thought you looked happier over there than","start":205.76,"end":208.77},{"text":"you've looked with me lately.","start":208.77,"end":210.07},{"text":"that's it.","start":211.45,"end":212.1},{"text":"that's the whole ugly thing.","start":212.76,"end":214.99},{"text":"that's what's been sitting in my chest for","start":215.34,"end":217.79},{"text":"the last hour while i said \"fine\" like an idiot.","start":217.79,"end":222.38},{"text":"no— don't.","start":223.96,"end":225.49},{"text":"don't do the face.","start":226.32,"end":227.35},{"text":"i'm not saying it to make you— i know it's","start":228.56,"end":232.49},{"text":"not fair.","start":232.49,"end":232.99},{"text":"i know.","start":233.84,"end":234.49},{"text":"he tells one funny story and i rewrite our","start":235.64,"end":238.57},{"text":"entire— that's insane, i know it's insane while","start":238.57,"end":243.42},{"text":"i'm doing it, that's the worst part.","start":243.42,"end":245.72},{"text":"there's a guy in my head going \"you sound crazy\"","start":246.99,"end":250.32},{"text":"and i'm going \"yes, thank you, aware.\" you","start":251.27,"end":256.7},{"text":"know what i did in this car before you got","start":257.71,"end":259.94},{"text":"in?","start":259.94,"end":260.22},{"text":"i practiced.","start":261.44,"end":262.07},{"text":"casual.","start":263.18,"end":263.85},{"text":"i rehearsed sounding like a person who was","start":264.9,"end":267.21},{"text":"not bothered.","start":267.21,"end":267.85},{"text":"out loud.","start":268.77,"end":269.42},{"text":"to the steering wheel.","start":270.22,"end":271.29},{"text":"\"how was the party?\" like that, all breezy.","start":271.29,"end":276.91},{"text":"the wheel was very convinced.","start":278.07,"end":279.62},{"text":"you…","start":280.94,"end":281.49},{"text":"less so.","start":281.49,"end":283.15},{"text":"three seconds.","start":284.45,"end":285.26},{"text":"it took you three seconds.","start":286.34,"end":287.83},{"text":"yeah, you can laugh.","start":289.49,"end":291.34},{"text":"laugh at me, i deserve it, it's— hmmmmm.","start":292.27,"end":296.95},{"text":"no, that laugh's okay.","start":298.34,"end":300.47},{"text":"that one i get to have.","start":301.52,"end":303.03},{"text":"hey.","start":304.51,"end":304.94},{"text":"hands off the wheel, see?","start":305.97,"end":307.4},{"text":"turning.","start":308.49,"end":308.98},{"text":"facing you.","start":310.09,"end":310.98},{"text":"full eye contact this is very hard for me right","start":311.99,"end":316.37},{"text":"now, please note the effort.","start":316.37,"end":318.57},{"text":"here's the thing i actually mean, under all","start":318.57,"end":322.31},{"text":"the stupid.","start":322.31,"end":322.71},{"text":"i don't think you're going anywhere.","start":324.84,"end":326.71},{"text":"it was never really about him.","start":328.22,"end":330.11},{"text":"it's that…","start":331.23,"end":331.96},{"text":"when you laughed like that, some small pathetic","start":333.19,"end":337.3},{"text":"part of me went, \"when's the last time i made","start":337.3,"end":341.12},{"text":"her do that?\" and i couldn't remember.","start":341.12,"end":344.33},{"text":"and it scared me.","start":345.8,"end":346.79},{"text":"that's the truth.","start":348.14,"end":348.91},{"text":"scared me more than any guy at any party ever","start":350.4,"end":353.19},{"text":"could.","start":353.19,"end":353.55},{"text":"don't— hey, no, don't cry, that's not— oh no.","start":355.19,"end":360.21},{"text":"come here.","start":361.67,"end":362.26},{"text":"come here.","start":363.82,"end":364.63},{"text":"ahhhhh…","start":364.63,"end":368.3},{"text":"okay.","start":368.3,"end":370.14},{"text":"okay.","start":370.14,"end":371.05},{"text":"i've got you.","start":371.05,"end":372.43},{"text":"shhh.","start":372.43,"end":372.6},{"text":"i've got you.","start":372.6,"end":376.39},{"text":"last week?","start":378.1,"end":378.95},{"text":"really?","start":380.07,"end":380.56},{"text":"the thing with the— the grocery store thing?","start":381.49,"end":385.54},{"text":"that made the list?","start":386.52,"end":387.61},{"text":"that's…","start":388.9,"end":389.77},{"text":"good to know.","start":389.77,"end":391.33},{"text":"honestly, i thought my material was slipping.","start":392.52,"end":395.51},{"text":"no, listen— hey.","start":397.14,"end":398.99},{"text":"look at me.","start":400.2,"end":400.77},{"text":"last thing, then i'll stop being heavy, promise.","start":400.77,"end":404.83},{"text":"if i ever do that again the fine, fine, i'm","start":406.63,"end":410.91},{"text":"fine routine you're allowed to just…","start":410.91,"end":414.55},{"text":"poke me.","start":414.55,"end":416.31},{"text":"in the ribs.","start":416.31,"end":418.17},{"text":"hard.","start":418.17,"end":419.11},{"text":"because marinating in it for an hour was so","start":419.4,"end":423.14},{"text":"much worse than just saying \"i got scared watching","start":423.14,"end":427.41},{"text":"you laugh at another man's joke.\" which, out","start":427.41,"end":432.33},{"text":"loud, is somehow both more embarrassing and…","start":432.33,"end":436.29},{"text":"lighter.","start":436.29,"end":437.21},{"text":"it's lighter now.","start":439.1,"end":440.09},{"text":"how is it lighter now?","start":441.37,"end":442.82},{"text":"because you didn't laugh at me.","start":444.11,"end":445.86},{"text":"yeah.","start":447.04,"end":447.63},{"text":"maybe that's it.","start":448.78,"end":449.73},{"text":"c'mere.","start":449.73,"end":451.1},{"text":"forehead.","start":452.32,"end":453.13},{"text":"just— there.","start":453.9,"end":456.03},{"text":"hmmmmm.","start":456.03,"end":457.72},{"text":"you smell like the party.","start":459.25,"end":460.68},{"text":"smoke and…","start":460.68,"end":463},{"text":"somebody's terrible cologne.","start":463.63,"end":465.66},{"text":"not yours.","start":466.76,"end":467.53},{"text":"please not yours.","start":468.74,"end":469.97},{"text":"okay, his.","start":469.97,"end":473.84},{"text":"noted.","start":475.02,"end":475.39},{"text":"filing that away in a healthy, non-jealous","start":476.29,"end":478.8},{"text":"manner.","start":479.29,"end":479.96},{"text":"i'm sorry about the silent car ride.","start":481.26,"end":483.69},{"text":"longest ten minutes of my life, for the record.","start":483.69,"end":487.83},{"text":"every sentence i started began with \"so, that","start":488.88,"end":493.57},{"text":"guy,\" and i knew how that would sound, so i","start":493.57,"end":497.93},{"text":"said nothing, which sounded worse.","start":497.93,"end":500.87},{"text":"genius move.","start":502.32,"end":503.13},{"text":"you're warm.","start":504.71,"end":505.34},{"text":"stay like this a second.","start":506.66,"end":508.05},{"text":"just…","start":509.24,"end":509.69},{"text":"one more second.","start":509.69,"end":511.96},{"text":"okay.","start":511.96,"end":512.72},{"text":"it's late.","start":516.76,"end":517.39},{"text":"you should go in.","start":518.2,"end":519.25},{"text":"but i'm walking you to the door.","start":520.27,"end":521.92},{"text":"slow.","start":523.04,"end":523.43},{"text":"embarrassingly slow.","start":525.03,"end":526.26},{"text":"old-man-with-a-newspaper slow.","start":526.26,"end":529.59},{"text":"because i did the math and the door is only","start":530.2,"end":533.15},{"text":"thirty feet away, and i'm not done being next","start":533.15,"end":537.2},{"text":"to you yet.","start":537.2,"end":537.9},{"text":"yeah.","start":540.16,"end":540.45},{"text":"that was smoother than anything i said all","start":541.68,"end":543.95},{"text":"night, wasn't it.","start":543.95,"end":545.25},{"text":"don't tell the steering wheel.","start":546.4,"end":547.77},{"text":"it thinks i'm cool.","start":547.77,"end":549.98},{"text":"come on.","start":549.98,"end":552.42},{"text":"slow.","start":553.08,"end":553.33}]